  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/tips_logo.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/alpha_background.gif\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"594\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/k.gif\" width=\"30\">HALDUN(칼둔)</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"290\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/dungeon/Khaldun_map.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"280\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:320/280\" width=\"320\"></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"300\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>던전설명 \n                                        :</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">미녹북광에 \n                            있는 통로를 이동하시면 쉽게 이동</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">하실 \n                            수 있습니다. 던전입구는 보시는 바와 같이</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">2군데가 \n                            존재합니다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">칼둔던전에서는 \n                            부활이 불가능합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">칼둔던전은 \n                            펠루카에서만 존재합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">칼둔던전에서 \n                            피케이를 할시에는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">Revenant</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">라는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">몬스터가 \n                            죽은사람 시체위에서 소환되고&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">피케이를 \n                            행한&nbsp;플레이어에게 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">끝까지 \n                            복수를 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_1.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_2.gif\" width=\"11\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_3.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전이동지역</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(같은 모양의 아이콘끼리 \n                                        이동됩니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\"> \n                                        : 비밀문이나 잠김문</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\"> \n                                        : 던전내 중요 지점</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(클릭 하시면 상세정보를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">----------------------------------------------</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"1082\" width=\"594\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"480\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"240\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/dungeon/Khaldun_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"180\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:180/180\" usemap=\"#ImageMap3\" width=\"180\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/dungeon/Khaldun_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"180\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:180/180\" usemap=\"#ImageMap4\" width=\"180\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"240\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">1. \n                                        미녹에서 북쪽광산까지 올라가시면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">미녹통로를 \n                                        보실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">2. \n                                        칼둔던전의 2개의 입구중</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">우측입구입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"400\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"288\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"350\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/dungeon/Khaldun_1.gif\" usemap=\"#ImageMap5\" width=\"400\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>주요 \n                                        몬스터 :</b></font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Lizard%20man.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>\n</b></font></span></a><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Skeleton.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Skeleton(스켈레톤)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n                            </font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Skeleton%20Knight.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Skeleton \n                                        Knight(스케레톤 나이트)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n                            </font></span><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Zombie/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Zombie(좀비)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Skeletal%20Mage.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Skeletal \n                                        Mage(스켈레톤 메이지)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n                            </font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Bone%20Knight.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Bone \n                                        Knight(본 나이트)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Ancient%20Lich.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Ancient \n                                        Lich(에이션트리치)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n                            </font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Cursed.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Cursed(커시드)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n                            </font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Revenant.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Revenant(레버넌트)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Shadow%20Fiend.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Shadow \n                                        Fiend(쉐도우핀드)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n                            </font></span><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/Spectral%20Armor.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Spectral \n                                        Armor(스펙트럴아머)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020821212432/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/dungeon/KKnight.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">Zealot \n                                        Of Khaldun,Knight(질럿나잇)</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">, \n         