    B지점의 스위치를 올리면 <img border=\"0\" height=\"9\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_4.gif\" width=\"13\">포인트의 \n                                        문이 열리게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                            </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"11\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/icon_5.gif\" width=\"11\">표시 \n                            2곳에서는 칼둔퍼즐이 있습니다. 칼둔퍼즐에대해서는 \n                            </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_puzzle_1/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">각종유용한정보-퍼즐편</font></span></a><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">을 \n                            참조 하시길.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16